ow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/acl-org/acl-anthology/commits/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","html_url":"https://github.com/acl-org/acl-anthology/commit/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb"}]},{"sha":"81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","node_id":"C_kwDOATKWqdoAKDgxYTRiNzc2Zjg0NGJhNzgwMzY2MTViODJjMTY4M2E3YWZjM2FkZmI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nathan Schneider","email":"nathan.schneider@georgetown.edu","date":"2026-10-12T18:53:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-12T18:53:12Z"},"message":"Fixed-case: new heuristics involving digits + rerun on all data (#10255)\n\n* truelist additions incl. some LM names\n\n* add truecasing heuristics for names containing numbers\n\n* truelist; command\n\n* look for any digit character, as numbers may contain decimal points\n\n* check the raw text to avoid false positive of hyphen acting as dash\n\n* truelist: \"Even\" produces false positives with English word\n\n* truelist\n\n* remove space after <i>\n\n* truelist; don't assume that post-hyphen word with digit is non-fixed-case\n\n* rerun protect.py on all data","tree":{"sha":"054a57792ec642d08dca476a9cdfb20be5722f51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/acl-org/acl-anthology/git/trees/054a57792ec642d08dca476a9cdfb20be5722f51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/acl-org/acl-anthology/git/commits/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqzSyYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7gQQAGYn/ZTEB+cE5PIv0lXaDNrj\nTCPXymVwG61F+LME0658ayHjJNntIupQudvZvk/8TTHA8/DQuor2nFpVRZBtnr+Q\nxLOjYaHp5jutbr15uWfXOrJPer0/NeXFKTwG3YVvxxubw8OtEwglp0qehJf+HJ+q\nHxH0ew1yP3qq/r8q8KL8X0Ts3QJY0CMUHkeEP/as6OFYYW5uAyHpH4G6JmHNfZF3\n8iidN87mT1b0pr5k5pihwPAfILI7XIUyAnKYR/cezHXChHa+T252r9ViwfsdLbCL\nqLjrN4EYAEW0y5s8IbWO9ExNuKyHSaQ9cYwSG7/o5jFF7CbzLyohEiUqtQNw9qcl\n46lCLUu6pyrErnbZpBqW+Wvw87m/shk/AYjrAD1skc4jqtmobOPlYg8uvV9ZX61L\nYmzNXs9SYbfzarws4DBmoOJi85Aic6yL79zYp+MB/rYu+GlhWpf/QqRQaM/Xir/z\ndnduZxJ3AnC4cYWLdvhQ/QV7+EXzlqad0iMMKJty0H+DtEH2pPTuyDkQE915ZKnq\np3QxJDVol21RbdKbsmcR0K6xK8sZD+YY7NZjlWLZmfLhIQr7y9x2F5tU9QIy96Tz\nbjWnjzaSjjuUeGeF3TuCHQ7s7ctn6qrRLKg6W4K3yx9PJHoFF6PBNKPlBGQknKnu\nCKA2kEDAROjoLdsQVjAZ\n=MB+b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 054a57792ec642d08dca476a9cdfb20be5722f51\nparent 8126eb360b6276255eda9c89363032e2c5183c6b\nauthor Nathan Schneider <nathan.schneider@georgetown.edu> 1791831192 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791831192 -0400\n\nFixed-case: new heuristics involving digits + rerun on all data (#10255)\n\n* truelist additions incl. some LM names\n\n* add truecasing heuristics for names containing numbers\n\n* truelist; command\n\n* look for any digit character, as numbers may contain decimal points\n\n* check the raw text to avoid false positive of hyphen acting as dash\n\n* truelist: \"Even\" produces false positives with English word\n\n* truelist\n\n* remove space after <i>\n\n* truelist; don't assume that post-hyphen word with digit is non-fixed-case\n\n* rerun protect.py on all data","verified_at":"2026-10-12T18:53:12Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/acl-org/acl-anthology/commits/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","html_url":"https://github.com/acl-org/acl-anthology/commit/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/acl-org/acl-anthology/commits/81a4b776f844ba78036615b82c1683a7afc3adfb/comments","author":{"login":"nschneid","id":985263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NTI2Mw==","avatar_url":"https